{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45139","headline":"霅溪馆送韩明府章辞满归 · 皎然","name":"霅溪馆送韩明府章辞满归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洛令从告还，故人东门饯。\n惠爱三年积，轩车一夜远。\n晓月离馆空，秋风故山晚。\n荣君有嘉荐，顾我阻游衍。\n宿昔峰顶心，依依不可卷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45139.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45139","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}